--TEST--
a cursor on the `match` keyword names no symbol, so rename is refused
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $n = 2;
string $label = mat<|>ch ($n) {
    1 => "one",
    default => "many",
};
echo $label;
--REQUEST--
rename to=total
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
